<title>SOUTH KOREA: South Korean stock market closed for Arbour Day.</title>
<headline>South Korean stock market closed for Arbour Day.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South Korean stock market is closed on Saturday for Arbour Day. The market will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>The composite index rose 8.68 points to 687.42 on Friday despite the central bank's downward revision of its forecast for this year's economic growth.</p>
<p>--Jean Yoon (822) 727 5643</p>
